[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Ah, the Gray Raven Commandant!",
        "Cv": 510030037.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "It really is you! I'm a big fan! What brings you to F.O.S. today? Are you guest lecturing, or here on a mission?",
        "Cv": 510030038.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Just looking around.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "It's classified.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Just looking around? But the classes are not running right now... not much to see.",
        "Cv": 510030039.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "A classified mission? Wow... you can count on me, my lips are sealed!",
        "Cv": 510030040.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "And the person with you... she's not a Gray Raven member, is she? Wait, she looks... familiar somehow.",
        "Cv": 510030041.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "She's my new squad member!",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "She's a new instructor!",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "...",
        "Cv": 510030042.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Right?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "...Yes. I'm a new recruit.",
        "Cv": 510030043.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "She looks like an attacker, too. Wouldn't that make four attackers in Gray Raven? I'm surprised Command would greenlight a squad composition like that.",
        "Cv": 510030044.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "...The Task Force uses whatever works to complete the objective. That's all that matters.",
        "Cv": 510030045.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "S-so, can I ask the question nobody else dares to?!",
        "Cv": 510030046.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 16,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "What?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 17,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "With her on the team, who's the strongest member of Gray Raven now?",
        "Cv": 510030047.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 18,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Every member is strong in their own way.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 19,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "If I had to guess... probably her.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 20,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "A vague answer like that just fuels speculation... Fine. It's me. I'm the strongest. Satisfied?",
        "Cv": 510030048.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 21,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "Hmph.",
        "Cv": 510030049.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 22,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "I see! You do carry that kind of aura. But, uh... wait, I feel like I've seen you before... maybe in a tactical bulletin...",
        "Cv": 510030050.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 23,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "You. That's enough questions.",
        "Cv": 510030051.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 24,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "...Right! Sorry, I've asked more than enough!",
        "Cv": 510030052.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 25,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Wow, really? A new instructor? What subject do you teach?",
        "Cv": 510030053.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 26,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "What subject...",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 27,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "...Target Neutralization. That should be obvious.",
        "Cv": 510030054.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 28,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Oh, right! I haven't seen it in the course catalog, but... I get it now! So the handcuffs are for the class, not for some... other reason.",
        "Cv": 510030055.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 29,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Hey.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 30,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "It's part of the standard curriculum.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 31,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Sorry, sorry! I just say whatever I'm thinking. It's just... those things on your wrists are hard to miss.",
        "Cv": 510030056.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 32,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "They're training restraints. We're conducting a field simulation.",
        "Cv": 510030057.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 33,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Now I'm really interested, Instructor! Could I get a preview of the course material? Like... how you'd actually subdue \u3010kuroname\u3011?",
        "Cv": 510030058.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 34,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "Should we demonstrate...?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 35,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "Hardly necessary. With or without these on, I could take down \u3010kuroname\u3011 anytime I wanted.",
        "Cv": 510030059.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 36,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "I see! You do carry that kind of aura. But, uh... wait, I feel like I've seen you before... maybe in a tactical bulletin...",
        "Cv": 510030060.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 37,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "You. That's enough questions.",
        "Cv": 510030061.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 38,
        "ActorName": "Male Student",
        "ActorTalk": "...Uh, ah, right! Y-yes! I've asked plenty!",
        "Cv": 510030062.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 39,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "You scared him off with just a look.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 40,
        "ActorName": null,
        "ActorTalk": "You didn't traumatize that student, did you?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 41,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "I don't plan on spending all day being stopped in hallways. The nuisance is dealt with. Move.",
        "Cv": 510030063.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 42,
        "ActorName": "Alpha",
        "ActorTalk": "And your cover stories were pathetic.",
        "Cv": 510030064.0,
        "Desc": null
    }
]